|GKB================================ Appraise ================================
|GKB=|XX0   Syntax: cappraise |YKB<item|opponent>|XX0                                    |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   Appraising an item will give you an idea of what it would be worth   |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   if you were to sell it at the shop.  Additionally, if the item can   |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   be used as a weapon or armour, you can determine it's relative       |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   usefulness as such.                                                  |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   Appraising an opponent will give you a sense of the opponent's       |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   strength, weapon class, and armour class relative to your own.       |GKB=
|GKB==========================================================================
